# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in what you need, then restart the dev
# server. Four of the six games work with no key at all.

# Optional. Without a key the Pokémon TCG API allows 1000 requests/day and
# 30/minute; with one you get 20,000/day. Get a key at https://pokemontcg.io/
VITE_POKEMONTCG_API_KEY=

# Required for Star Wars: Unlimited and the One Piece Card Game — both are
# served by apitcg.com, which rejects unauthenticated requests. Without it those
# two games show an "isn't set up yet" panel; the other four are unaffected.
# Free account at https://apitcg.com/register, key at https://apitcg.com/platform/api-key
VITE_APITCG_API_KEY=

# Magic (Scryfall), Yu-Gi-Oh! (YGOPRODeck) and Disney Lorcana (Lorcast) need no
# key and are called directly from the browser.
